  "goodToKnow": "Der Urenkel is a great-grandson or great-grandchild, die Urenkelin a great-granddaughter. The prefix Ur- adds one generation: Urgroßmutter, Urgroßvater, and Ururenkel (great-great-grandchild). Der Enkel is a grandchild. Ur- also means original or primeval: der Urwald, die Urzeit. The plural is the same: die Urenkel."
